@startuml
title Dataflow for sample-1
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam ranksep 60
top to bottom direction

actor "User" as User
component "Frontend (React + Vite)" as Frontend
component "Parse API (FastAPI)" as Parser
component "Parsed Text" as ParsedText
component "Entities" as Entities
component "Skills" as Skills
component "Recommendations" as Recs
database "MySQL" as DB
component "Puter.js (in-browser AI)" as Puter

User --> Frontend : open app / upload resume
Frontend --> Parser : file upload (raw bytes)
Parser --> ParsedText : extracted text (86 chars)
ParsedText --> Entities : detect emails (1), phones (1)
ParsedText --> Skills : detected (3)
ParsedText --> Recs : generate (2)
ParsedText --> Frontend : return parsed text
Frontend --> Puter : analyze parsed text + JD (local)
Frontend --> DB : save structured result (via Save API)
DB --> Frontend : stored id / confirmation

note top of ParsedText
  Parsed text is the primary artifact created by the parser.
end note
note right of Skills
  Skills are extracted entities used by the frontend and recommendations.
end note

@enduml